{"id":"b9f22036ffa6885b","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-karp-lipton.md","title":"thm-karp-lipton (Karp-Lipton Theorem)","display":"thm-karp-lipton (Karp-Lipton Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-p-poly]]","[[28-df-ph]]","[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","[[28-df-pi-k-p]]","[[28-thm-ph-collapse]]"],"display":"thm-karp-lipton (Karp-Lipton Theorem)","label":"28-thm-karp-lipton","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-karp-lipton","Karp-Lipton Theorem","NP circuits collapse PH"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" href=\"?note=bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" title=\"28-df-p-poly\">28-df-p-poly</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3490cd4d54ac2474\" href=\"?note=3490cd4d54ac2474\" title=\"28-df-ph\">28-df-ph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2bc4265180c3d2ff\" href=\"?note=2bc4265180c3d2ff\" title=\"28-df-pi-k-p\">28-df-pi-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8469ff36e1bb7dd6\" href=\"?note=8469ff36e1bb7dd6\" title=\"28-thm-ph-collapse\">28-thm-ph-collapse</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-karp-lipton (Karp-Lipton Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-karp-lipton"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-karp-lipton</span><span>Karp-Lipton Theorem</span><span>NP circuits collapse PH</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span>、非一致电路类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{P/poly}\">\\(\\mathbf{P/poly}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PH}\">\\(\\mathbf{PH}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Sigma_2^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见本目录对应定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{P/poly}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{PH}=\\Sigma_2^{\\mathbf P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{P/poly}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{PH}=\\Sigma_2^{\\mathbf P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>假设给出 SAT 的多项式大小判定电路，利用 SAT 自归约逐位寻找证据并展开为多项式大小多输出电路。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\exists v\\,\\varphi(u,v)\">\\(\\forall u\\exists v\\,\\varphi(u,v)\\)</span>，先存在猜测该证据生成电路，再全称检验每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的输出确实使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为真，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Sigma_2\\)</span> 描述。若原公式为假，任何电路都无法为失败的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 输出证据，因此无需假设猜测电路在其他输入上正确。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2\\subseteq\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Pi_2\\subseteq\\Sigma_2\\)</span> 连同补类关系和 PH 坍塌定理推出结论。旧稿第二条无条件写出的高层相等式遗漏 NP 小电路前提，已消除。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理6.19及证明；印刷113–114页；PDF139–140页。陈述及猜测证据电路证明已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p-poly","status":"resolved","id":"bdb0c5ef1940ab80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p-poly]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"3490cd4d54ac2474","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pi-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"2bc4265180c3d2ff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pi-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-ph-collapse","status":"resolved","id":"8469ff36e1bb7dd6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-ph-collapse]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{P/poly}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_2^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{P/poly}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{PH}=\\Sigma_2^{\\mathbf P}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u\\exists v\\,\\varphi(u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_2","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_2\\subseteq\\Sigma_2","display":false}],"bytes":1460,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"层级关系：[[28-thm-atm-characterizes-ph]]、[[28-thm-ph-contained-pspace]]、[[28-thm-ph-collapse]]、[[28-thm-karp-lipton]]。"}],"outgoing":["0cb5248561455df8","bdb0c5ef1940ab80","3490cd4d54ac2474","e4f9f10bc85fd486","2bc4265180c3d2ff","8469ff36e1bb7dd6"]}